msgstr "保存"

msgid "No profiles yet. Adjust your monitors and save the first one above."
msgstr "还没有配置文件。调整显示器后，在上方保存第一个。"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "添加"

msgid "Apply the most recent entry at startup"
msgstr "启动时应用最近的一条"

msgid "Useful if the computer was off at the scheduled time."
msgstr "适用于计划时间电脑处于关机状态的情况。"

